  sentences:
  - text: "What\u2019s this?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'While the pain is still pulsing through my head, I see something in my
      inner eye. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s like I\u2019m dreaming."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the darkness i see multiple swirls of what looks like dust or very distant
      stars. They are moving around a lot and sometimes they form circles. It is
      both mesmerising and terrifying.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9a30f0f4419ca0e4fbae37cd4ae0090c, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8327ef801bac8054bac523b5c5102426, type: 2}
